# (AI-assisted) the HUD while collecting: Sentinel Beach, precursor orbs fly into the HUD's orb counter
# (convert-to-hud-object: merc HUD models), the orb and power cell counters show (their icons and
# glow particles), then the progress menu opens (its frame, power cells, orbs). Host checks:
# CTR_SOFT_F24=1 (the 3DS's float24 depth), CTR_SOFT_DEFER=1 (the render thread's latest timing);
# pictures with --ctr-dump DIR --ctr-dump-every N.
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
60 continue beach-start
61 wait *target* target-continue
62 wait *target* target-stance
100 log hud-collect
110 call pevent target get-pickup 6 f1
120 call pevent target get-pickup 5 f1
130 call pevent money pickup
160 call pevent money pickup
190 call pevent money pickup
220 call pevent target get-pickup 5 f1
230 call pevent money pickup
260 call pevent money pickup
290 call pevent money pickup
320 call pevent target get-pickup 5 f1
330 call pevent money pickup
360 call pevent money pickup
420 shot hud_collect
430 log hud-collect-end
440 log menu
441 start
446 -
560 shot hud_menu
600 right
606 -
680 shot hud_menu2
700 start
706 -
760 log menu-end
761 exit
